serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Monitoring and responding to support tickets through our ticketing system.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Performing initial troubleshooting and issue analysis.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Escalating complex issues to Tier 2 or Engineering when required.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Managing customer communication and ensuring timely updates in accordance with our SLA commitments.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Providing remote technical support to Field Service Engineers while they are working onsite at customer locations.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What are the required qualifications of a Technical Support Representative II?</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;2+ years of experience in technical support, supporting IoT devices, field hardware, and networking systems.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Networking Fundamentals:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Solid grasp of the TCP/IP model (e.g., Transport Layer: handles end-to-end communication, flow control, and error recovery via TCP/UDP), Static IP vs. DHCP reservations, NTP time synchronization, MAC-address whitelisting, and Wi-Fi bands (2.4 GHz vs. 5 GHz).</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">IoT Device Lifecycle:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Practical experience with Gateways, Sensors, and Routers&mdash;including provisioning, asset mapping, field commissioning, and Over-The-Air (OTA) firmware updates.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cellular Connectivity:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Understanding of SIM lifecycle operations (activations, suspensions, expiration, ICCID/IMEI verification, roaming), custom APN authentication, and cellular failover/interface priority settings.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">RF & Signal Metrics:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ability to read and analyze wireless signal health metrics, including RSSI, SNR, RSRP, SINR, and BLE signal metrics.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cloud Platform & Security:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Tahoma,sans-serif;color:#262321;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, or GCP), implementing least-privilege access, secure remote access via bastion hosts, and managing identity protocols (SSO, OAuth, MFA).</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=